## Completion checklist
1. Restore execution environment and materialize the current database and exact app inventory.
2. Preserve file identities/version histories; back up current database and source builds.
3. Run the Hox tests and additive database import checks.
4. Add app-specific opt-in mappings; preserve all existing content and saves.
5. Test current browser and native targets, regenerate distribution packages, and replace corresponding saved files.
6. Record each target's actual tested version; keep unsupported service features explicitly pending.
